Subject: Map original paired-single matrix inverse to the sole native SDK
Upstream-base: 7a6bf165d9f1c5914181c079c7d4bfa7204f3509

The original HOME GUI requests PSMTXInverse during Init. The actual native
SDK already owns C_MTXInverse; expose its matching u32 signature through
the existing native-only aliases. Preserve all source algorithms, callers
and console declarations. Native float arithmetic does not claim exact
paired-single rounding.

--- a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/mtx/mtx.h
+++ b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/mtx/mtx.h
@@ -44,6 +44,7 @@
 void C_MTXTransApply(const Mtx, Mtx, f32, f32, f32);
 void C_MTXCopy(const Mtx, Mtx);
 u32 C_MTXInvXpose(const Mtx, Mtx);
+u32 C_MTXInverse(const Mtx, Mtx);
 #ifndef PSMTXIdentity
 #define PSMTXIdentity C_MTXIdentity
 #endif
@@ -65,6 +66,9 @@
 #ifndef PSMTXCopy
 #define PSMTXCopy C_MTXCopy
 #endif
+#ifndef PSMTXInverse
+#define PSMTXInverse C_MTXInverse
+#endif
 #ifndef PSMTXInvXpose
 #define PSMTXInvXpose C_MTXInvXpose
 #endif
